Abi, right?

252
00:12:58,068 --> 00:12:59,069
It's Bea now.

253
00:12:59,737 --> 00:13:02,156
I came here because

254
00:13:02,239 --> 00:13:03,991
I want to change my name again.

255
00:13:04,074 --> 00:13:06,076
You need a fake passport?

256
00:13:06,160 --> 00:13:08,287
For my mom and me.

257
00:13:09,079 --> 00:13:10,414
Hmm…

258
00:13:10,498 --> 00:13:13,209
Looks like you and your mom
are in trouble.

259
00:13:13,292 --> 00:13:14,418
Where are you running off to?

260
00:13:15,169 --> 00:13:16,170
Can you do it?

261
00:13:16,253 --> 00:13:17,755
Absolutely.

262
00:13:18,797 --> 00:13:20,424
Okay, how much?

263
00:13:20,508 --> 00:13:25,304
Well, since Caloy likes you…

264
00:13:25,387 --> 00:13:28,307
[CHUCKLES AWKWARDLY]
I'm his girlfriend, actually.

265
00:13:28,390 --> 00:13:30,351
- We're together.
- [LAUGHS]

266
00:13:31,101 --> 00:13:33,354
Too bad he's in jail. [CHUCKLES]

267
00:13:35,064 --> 00:13:36,190
How much will it cost?

268
00:13:36,273 --> 00:13:39,151
[CLICKS TEETH] Well…

269
00:13:39,235 --> 00:13:42,238
You can definitely afford it.

270
00:13:42,321 --> 00:13:44,532
- 600,000.
- 600,000?!

271
00:13:45,157 --> 00:13:46,575
What?

272
00:13:47,076 --> 00:13:47,952
Look.

273
00:13:50,579 --> 00:13:53,249
Two passports will need
two birth certificates as well.

274
00:13:53,332 --> 00:13:55,709
I'm not even going to ask
for a down payment.

275
00:13:55,793 --> 00:13:56,835
This is a good deal.

276
00:13:56,919 --> 00:13:59,505
If you don't want it, find someone else.

277
00:13:59,588 --> 00:14:02,508
No, no, no. I'll pay 600,000.

278
00:14:02,591 --> 00:14:04,552
- But are you sure you can do it?
- Absolutely.

279
00:14:05,511 --> 00:14:07,096
- Okay. I'll take your word.
- Okay.

280
00:14:13,394 --> 00:14:14,853
600,000 pesos?

281
00:14:14,937 --> 00:14:17,606
Where am I going to get that much money?

282
00:14:19,900 --> 00:14:24,238
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

283
00:14:24,321 --> 00:14:26,740
[LINE RINGING]

284
00:14:26,824 --> 00:14:28,284
Pick up.

285
00:14:28,993 --> 00:14:29,869
Hello?

286
00:14:29,952 --> 00:14:31,120
Peter?

287
00:14:31,203 --> 00:14:33,372
Peter, listen to me. This is urgent.

288
00:14:33,455 --> 00:14:34,331
Listen to me.

289
00:14:34,415 --> 00:14:36,917
I need 10 million pesos cash, or else!

290
00:14:37,001 --> 00:14:38,794
That's too much, Bea!

291
00:14:39,545 --> 00:14:41,297
I already gave you money.

292
00:14:41,380 --> 00:14:42,673
I already gave you the files.

293
00:14:42,756 --> 00:14:45,175
I did everything you asked me to do!

294
00:14:45,259 --> 00:14:46,343
This is not too much!

295
00:14:46,427 --> 00:14:48,470
The files were useless!
I didn't use them, did I?

296
00:14:48,554 --> 00:14:50,347
So, you listen to me, okay?

297
00:14:50,431 --> 00:14:52,349
<i>This is our new deal.</i>

298
00:14:52,433 --> 00:14:55,436
<i>You give me 10 million pesos cash tomorrow</i>

299
00:14:56,061 --> 00:15:00,024
or our pictures,
your pictures, it will go viral.

300
00:15:00,107 --> 00:15:01,400
So you choose.

301
00:15:01,483 --> 00:15:03,944
You will give me 10 million pesos cash

302
00:15:04,028 --> 00:15:07,907
or bye-bye lawyer,
bye-bye wife, bye-bye family!

303
00:15:07,990 --> 00:15:11,493
Now, you answer me.
What will it be?

304
00:15:11,577 --> 00:15:17,166
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

305
00:15:17,249 --> 00:15:20,586
Peter, I promise you,
this is the last time, okay?

306
00:15:20,669 --> 00:15:21,545
I swear.

307
00:15:21,629 --> 00:15:24,256
Just give me 10 million pesos.

308
00:15:24,340 --> 00:15:27,843
Then I'm out of your life.
You'll never see me again.

309
00:15:27,927 --> 00:15:29,219
I'll delete all the pictures.

310
00:15:29,303 --> 00:15:31,221
I promise. This is the last time.

311
00:15:31,305 --> 00:15:37,811
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

312
00:15:37,895 --> 00:15:41,398
[BREATHING HEAVILY]

313
00:15:45,402 --> 00:15:48,864
[VEHICLES HONKING]

314
00:15:49,782 --> 00:15:55,204
[MOROSE MUSIC PLAYING]

315
00:16:11,679 --> 00:16:16,558
[MOROSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

316
00:16:33,826 --> 00:16:40,207
[MOROSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

317
00:16:55,514 --> 00:17:01,311
[MOROSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

318
00:17:17,453 --> 00:17:20,831
[MOROSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

319
00:17:23,459 --> 00:17:24,668
Come in.

320
00:17:25,878 --> 00:17:26,879
Right there.

321
00:17:27,463 --> 00:17:30,257
Uh, just let me know if you need help

322
00:17:30,340 --> 00:17:32,926
bringing Enrico's things to the hospital.

323
00:17:33,010 --> 00:17:33,969
Thanks.

324
00:17:34,053 --> 00:17:35,137
All right.

325
00:17:42,686 --> 00:17:49,026
[PENSIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

326
00:18:04,500 --> 00:18:11,465
[PENSIVE MUSIC CONTINUES]

327
00:18:26,480 --> 00:18:32,402
[PENSIVE MUSIC CONTINUES]

328
00:18:44,873 --> 00:18:47,668
[ENRICO] <i>My big girl is 15 years old now.</i>

329
00:18:47,751 --> 00:18:49,211
<i>Time sure flies, doesn't it?</i>

330
00:18:50,254 --> 00:18:52,172
<i>Happy birthday, my dear.</i>

331
00:18:52,256 --> 00:18:54,967
<i>I heard you're consistently</i>
<i>an honors student.</i>

332
00:18:55,968 --> 00:18:58,137
<i>I'm so proud.</i>

333
00:18:59,346 --> 00:19:02,641
<i>I'm sorry if my only gift</i>
<i>to you is my prayers.</i>

334
00:19:02,724 --> 00:19:04,935
<i>I'll make it up to you next time.</i>

335
00:19:05,602 --> 00:19:07,646
<i>Happy 18th birthday, my dear!</i>

336
00:19:08,188 --> 00:19:11,275
<i>I can't believe you're 18 already.</i>

337
00:19:11,358 --> 00:19:14,653
<i>It's a shame I won't be</i>
<i>your last dance at your debut.</i>

338
00:19:14,736 --> 00:19:16,864
<i>Congratulations, my dear!</i>

339
00:19:16,947 --> 00:19:20,826
<i>I am so proud of you</i>
<i>and your company's success.</i>

340
00:19:21,577 --> 00:19:25,164
<i>I hope LoveList will continue to prosper.</i>

341
00:19:25,247 --> 00:19:27,916
<i>I'm here, cheering you on.</i>

342
00:19:28,000 --> 00:19:33,463
[POIGNANT MUSIC PLAYING]

343
00:19:44,349 --> 00:19:47,769
[MACHINE BEEPING STEADILY]

344
00:19:47,853 --> 00:19:51,857
[POIGNANT MUSIC CONTINUES]

345
00:19:53,066 --> 00:19:57,738
[MACHINE BEEPING STEADILY]

346
00:19:57,821 --> 00:20:02,826
[POIGNANT MUSIC CONTINUES]

347
00:20:07,331 --> 00:20:08,498
[DINO] <i>What do you want?</i>

348
00:20:08,582 --> 00:20:09,791
<i>I know about your plan.</i>

349
00:20:09,875 --> 00:20:11,501
<i>Keep your mouth shut.</i>

350
00:20:11,585 --> 00:20:13,545
<i>Let me join your group.</i>

351
00:20:13,629 --> 00:20:17,591
<i>Your and your mother's passports</i>
<i>and birth certificates are ready.</i>

352
00:20:17,674 --> 00:20:21,094
<i>Oliver will stay there.</i>
<i>As well as Dad.</i>

353
00:20:21,178 --> 00:20:23,347
<i>You're letting your father</i>
<i>live here with us?</i>

354
00:20:23,430 --> 00:20:25,682
[PRECIOUS] <i>Are you sure</i>
<i>about this, Billy?</i>

355
00:20:25,766 --> 00:20:27,476
<i>Still trying to locate</i>
<i>the LoveLine hacker?</i>

356
00:20:27,559 --> 00:20:29,978
<i>This is the only way</i>
<i>I can help Billy.</i>

357
00:20:30,062 --> 00:20:31,188
<i>You know what else</i>
<i>you could do?</i>

358
00:20:31,271 --> 00:20:34,358
<i>Tell Billy your true feelings.</i>

359
00:20:34,441 --> 00:20:35,651
[JORDAN] <i>They've recovered</i>
<i>some of your things.</i>

360
00:20:35,734 --> 00:20:37,110
<i>Would you like to see?</i>

361
00:20:37,194 --> 00:20:38,403
[BEA] <i>I won't let you go to jail.</i>

362
00:20:38,487 --> 00:20:40,822
<i>I've become even more</i>
<i>of a burden to you.</i>

363
00:20:40,906 --> 00:20:42,866
<i>You'll never be a burden to me.</i>

364
00:20:42,950 --> 00:20:44,743
<i>You're the only family I have.</i>

365
00:20:44,826 --> 00:20:46,370
[MARIELA]
<i>You still have a father.</i>

366
00:20:46,453 --> 00:20:48,956
[BILLY] <i>I'm tired of getting my hopes</i>
<i>up for nothing, Auntie.</i>

367
00:20:49,039 --> 00:20:51,917
<i>So I'll put a stop to them myself.</i>

368
00:20:52,000 --> 00:20:54,044
<i>How dare you show up here?!</i>

369
00:20:54,127 --> 00:20:55,671
<i>And you're blaming me</i>
<i>for what happened?</i>

370
00:20:55,754 --> 00:20:57,339
<i>I'm not an idiot!</i>

371
00:20:57,422 --> 00:20:59,800
<i>My father almost died.</i>

372
00:20:59,883 --> 00:21:01,551
<i>That's karma!</i>

373
00:21:01,635 --> 00:21:02,678
[BILLY] <i>Bea!</i>

374
00:21:02,761 --> 00:21:05,555
[BOTH GRUNTING]

375
00:21:05,639 --> 00:21:07,224
<i>Get off me!</i>
